@startuml outbox-relay
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
left to right direction

state "Unpublished" as New : written with the\nbusiness change
state "Waiting for retry" as Retry : attempts + 1,\nnextAttemptAt = now + backoff
state "Published" as Published : publishedAt set
state "Deleted" as Deleted

[*] --> New
New --> Published : relay picks the oldest\nevent of its key, Kafka acks
New --> Retry : send failed
Retry --> Published : retry succeeded
Retry --> Retry : failed again
Published --> Deleted : retention expired\n(cleanup job)
Deleted --> [*]

note bottom of Retry
  later events with the same key (user id)
  wait for this one, other keys keep flowing:
  per-user order is preserved
end note
@enduml
